SINQ-derived offline normalization and reference fixtures

The normalization in src/llama-sinq.cpp is a C++ adaptation of the
numerical procedure in huawei-csl/SINQ, revision
42ca83edf8fe1afc48c40fca6acc973c5d2bb59f.

